      "text": "recompute costs about one extra forward per layer, roughly a third more compute\naccumulation matches only when every micro-batch has the same number of tokens\nthe s² term comes back with the math fallback, for example an explicit attention mask\na busy laptop wobbles: recompute read 61,761 tokens/s at step 50, 43,959 at step 100",
